  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ashutosh Gupta vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 14 May, 2025 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc:78713-Db Court No. - 39 Case :- Writ - C No. - 13346 of 2025 Petitioner :- Ashutosh Gupta Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others",
    "facts": "There was raid conducted by respondent no.3 (the Food Safety Officer) on 20th July, 2020. In the meantime, there was order dated 24th March, 2021 passed for the goods as could be shifted from the godown. His client's father was unaware of the order and died soon after. 2. Mr. Jaiswal submits further, under section 41 in Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, respondent no.3 has power to seize food articles only. He seeks interference, for release of the godown.",
    "arguments": "3. Mr. Raj Mohan Upadhaya, learned advocate, Additional Chief Standing Counsel appears on behalf of State and relies on section 38 but he is unable to demonstrate power to seal the premises provided thereunder.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Mr. Raj Mohan Upadhaya, learned advocate, Additional Chief Standing Counsel appears on behalf of State and relies on section 38 but he is unable to demonstrate power to seal the premises provided thereunder.",
